<span id="S4.T1.3.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">A naive approach that copies the source input text without any modification.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.3.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.3.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:62.6pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T1.3.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Target</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.3.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.3.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:284.5pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.3.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">A naive approach that copies the target text as the rewritten text.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.3.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.3.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.5pt;padding-bottom:0.5pt;">
<span id="S4.T1.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:62.6pt;">
